<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST-S.African economic indicators consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-S.African economic indicators consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African economic indicators scheduled for release next week include:</p>
<p>DAY    GMT   INDICATOR    PERIOD  FORECAST   RANGE     PREVIOUS</p>
<p>TUE    0900  PPI Y/Y	APR     9.5 PCT    9.1/9.7    9.6</p>
<p>TUE    0900  PPI M/M	APR     0.9 PCT    0.6/1.2    0.1</p>
